				"description_loc"
				{
					"english"		"Before the darkness was lit up with lights, the thieves ruled the night with stealth and cunning. Join your friends, stealth your way through Victorian Era streets and Pick Pocket your way to the top. Stay vigilant as other thieves will be out and about, ready to steal your rewards or as easy marks to increase your stash. Avoid the Bobbies, vanish from the light and disappear with your ill gotten goods by day break."
				}
				"description"		"Before the darkness was lit up with lights, the thieves ruled the night with stealth and cunning. Join your friends, stealth your way through Victorian Era streets and Pick Pocket your way to the top. Stay vigilant as other thieves will be out and about, ready to steal your rewards or as easy marks to increase your stash. Avoid the Bobbies, vanish from the light and disappear with your ill gotten goods by day break."
